OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies after crashes shut
OL,4,Amotorway
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 30s died after the car
OL,7,Fshe was driving on the M4 was involved
OL,8,Fin a crash with a lorry, police said.
OL,10,FThe motorway was shut both ways between
OL,11,Fjunction 8/9 for Maidenhead and
OL,12,Fjunction 10 for Reading after two
OL,13,Faccidents at about 21:00 BST on
OL,14,FWednesday.
OL,16,FThe woman's white Mercedes 220 was in a
OL,17,Fcollision with a white Scania lorry on
OL,18,Fthe westbound carriageway. Shortly
OL,19,Fafter that, a second crash involving a
OL,20,Fgrey Kia Sorento happened on the
OL,21,Feastbound carriageway.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
