OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies after crashes shut
OL,4,Amotorway
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo one has been arrested and the
OL,7,Feastbound carriageway reopened at about
OL,8,F13:40. National Highways said it was
OL,9,Fcompleting work on the westbound
OL,10,Fcarriageway and that will stay shut for
OL,11,Fthe time being.
